				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Hello all, my name is Grant Fallstar.  Some of you know me better as Wwallace.  I quit my guild, Wudan, a while back because of personal differences with some of the leadership in that guild.  I wish them the best, but I kind of need to move to a guild that suits me more.  From what i hear, CotW is still made up of some of the same cool people that i knew when i was in HoN all those years ago.  I no longer have the will to be a part of wudan after needra and kadarx "quit" so to speak.  they were the heart and soul of wudan (i was in PDM with them, and then wudan) and the current leadership just does not suit my taste.  I enjoy hanging out with friends and accomplishing things in a fun setting.
<br />

<br />
